[00:00.76]1. Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.33]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:07.90]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:10.45]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:13.00]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:15.93]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:19.23]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:22.53]Letting all his victims go.
[00:26.53](Chorus)
[00:34.36]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:39.26]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:45.40]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:52.51]As the apple of my eye.
[01:02.97]2. Even though your foes are many,
[01:05.72]Though they threaten and revile,
[01:08.48]Though they flatter and they smile,
[01:11.23]To mislead and to beguile.
[01:17.23]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[01:19.56]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:21.89]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:24.23]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:28.73](Chorus)
[01:33.23]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:40.70]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:47.37]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:54.03]As the apple of my eye.
[02:01.34]3. Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:04.64]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:07.94]Though you die upon the field,
[02:11.84]Even death to me will yield.
[02:16.22]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.50]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:22.78]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.46]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:28.83](Chorus)
[02:31.20]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:38.49]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:47.32]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:52.70]As the apple of my eye.